WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.210
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:06.480 --> 00:07.680
I’m pretty good at sex, you know.

3
00:07.680 --> 00:09.320
You literally just found that out last night

4
00:09.960 --> 00:10.320
Who

5
00:11.000 --> 00:11.440
From now on,

6
00:11.440 --> 00:13.040
we’ll be nothing more than boss and subordinate

7
00:13.040 --> 00:14.320
Yok’s job is to learn as an intern,

8
00:14.320 --> 00:15.400
and my job is to teach Yok.

9
00:16.120 --> 00:16.480
OK？

10
00:16.480 --> 00:18.720
Are you and Yok going to Pattaya together

11
00:18.720 --> 00:19.680
Can I come with you, too?

12
00:19.680 --> 00:20.680
We’re not going there for fun.

13
00:20.680 --> 00:22.000
It’s enough that you’re going with Yok.

14
00:26.360 --> 00:27.160
Itt

15
00:28.960 --> 00:29.400
Want some?

16
00:30.120 --> 00:31.600
I thought you said we were going to talk about work.

17
00:31.600 --> 00:32.960
Then what was that at the beach?

18
00:32.960 --> 00:34.280
I’ll make you get over me.

19
00:34.280 --> 00:36.000
You really think someone like you can pull that off.

20
00:43.920 --> 00:46.760
Dammit, why do we have to take the fire escape?

21
00:46.800 --> 00:48.720
And you went so hard on me last night.

22
00:48.720 --> 00:49.840
How am I supposed to walk down?

23
00:50.200 --> 00:51.480
Taking the elevator is too risky.

24
00:51.520 --> 00:52.480
Risky how?

25
00:52.520 --> 00:53.720
Nobody's gonna notice me in this outfit.

26
00:53.720 --> 00:55.040
No one's going to care.

27
00:55.600 --> 00:57.600
P'Ing, can you just stop complaining?

28
00:58.640 --> 00:59.440
Dammit.

29
01:03.000 --> 01:04.239
How many floors are there?

30
01:04.360 --> 01:05.160
Let me help.

31
01:05.160 --> 01:06.240
No way.

32
01:06.240 --> 01:08.240
What if you suddenly shove me down the stairs?

33
01:08.520 --> 01:09.520
I don't trust you.

34
01:12.160 --> 01:13.280
Hurry up, P'Ing.

35
01:13.280 --> 01:15.880
Yok, I'm in pain here.

36
01:16.440 --> 01:17.760
Ow, you little...

37
03:33.920 --> 03:34.760
I really don't get it.

38
03:34.800 --> 03:37.200
Why do we have to book a hotel now that we're back?

39
03:38.920 --> 03:40.320
Isn't this a bit overkill?

40
03:41.680 --> 03:42.680
Your room is over there.

41
03:43.240 --> 03:43.880
I'm leaving.

42
03:44.560 --> 03:45.360
Hold on.

43
03:46.800 --> 03:47.960
Aren't you afraid your family will find out?

44
03:48.000 --> 03:49.320
Here, just put this on.

45
03:49.440 --> 03:50.920
I don't need one of these

46
03:50.960 --> 03:52.920
because this limited-edition face of mine

47
03:52.960 --> 03:54.480
is meant to be seen by everyone.

48
03:55.240 --> 03:55.760
Go on.

49
03:56.360 --> 03:57.160
I'm really leaving now.

50
03:57.560 --> 03:58.160
Hey.

51
03:58.600 --> 04:00.040
Take your bag with you.

52
04:03.920 --> 04:05.760
You actually look pretty good with those.

53
04:12.240 --> 04:14.360
[Ing: Are you back at the hotel yet?]

54
04:14.400 --> 04:16.320
[Ing: You're still alive, right?]

55
04:16.360 --> 04:18.120
[Ing: Voice message]

56
04:18.160 --> 04:19.360
Why isn't he answering?

57
04:19.880 --> 04:21.000
Is he dead or something?

58
04:22.320 --> 04:23.400
Go away.

59
04:25.040 --> 04:26.040
What are you doing?

60
04:26.080 --> 04:27.160
I don't feel anything for P'Ing.

61
04:27.160 --> 04:28.320
I know I have no right to say this...

62
04:29.280 --> 04:30.000
I need to check your pocket.

63
04:30.040 --> 04:31.040
Or do you want me to call the police?

64
04:31.040 --> 04:32.000
But there's this one person...

65
04:34.159 --> 04:35.000
who's so talented.

66
04:36.600 --> 04:39.360
He's someone I could never catch up to...

67
04:58.240 --> 04:59.040
Yes, P'Ing?

68
04:59.760 --> 05:01.160
So you're not dead yet?

69
05:04.720 --> 05:05.880
I'm in my room.

70
05:06.960 --> 05:07.920
Yesterday...

71
05:08.520 --> 05:09.440
I had quite a bit to drink.

72
05:11.520 --> 05:12.680
Were you drinking with Yok?

73
05:18.560 --> 05:19.760
Do you like Yok?

74
05:23.000 --> 05:24.320
You know what kind of person I am.

75
05:24.360 --> 05:25.680
Can you just stay out of this?

76
05:27.760 --> 05:29.400
But he doesn't like you.

77
05:32.320 --> 05:34.320
And his family will never accept you.

78
05:35.400 --> 05:37.159
Just mind your own business, will you?

79
05:38.720 --> 05:39.680
Does that mean...

80
05:40.880 --> 05:42.600
you're not serious about him?

81
05:43.000 --> 05:44.400
Stop meddling and stop asking

82
05:44.440 --> 05:45.480
so many questions.

83
05:45.960 --> 05:47.000
I'm sorry.

84
05:47.600 --> 05:48.800
Please don't be mad at me.

85
05:49.640 --> 05:51.200
Your voice is completely hoarse.

86
05:51.520 --> 05:52.600
Make sure you drink lots of water.

87
05:52.680 --> 05:54.200
When I sent you those messages,

88
05:54.280 --> 05:55.400
why didn't you reply?

89
05:56.680 --> 05:58.040
I was just about to,

90
05:58.120 --> 06:00.320
but you called first.

91
06:00.520 --> 06:02.600
How could I ever dare to ignore your messages?

92
06:04.360 --> 06:06.560
Whatever. Get yourself sorted out quickly

93
06:06.600 --> 06:07.560
and get over to the site.

94
06:07.560 --> 06:08.760
Take plenty of photos to send to Mr. Phet,

95
06:08.800 --> 06:09.720
understand?

96
06:10.200 --> 06:11.040
Will do.

97
06:11.680 --> 06:12.240
And...

98
06:12.680 --> 06:13.840
are you with Yok?

99
06:14.840 --> 06:16.320
You're asking way too many questions.

100
06:17.720 --> 06:18.440
Hello?

101
06:20.320 --> 06:21.160
Hello?

102
06:41.560 --> 06:42.240
Hello?

103
06:43.880 --> 06:46.320
Bring several bottles of your most expensive liquor

104
06:46.320 --> 06:49.040
to room 3102, please.

105
06:50.000 --> 06:50.400
Yes.

106
06:51.120 --> 06:52.480
Bring everything you've got.

107
06:53.600 --> 06:54.560
I'll finish them all.

108
06:55.280 --> 06:56.320
Bring everything you've got.

109
06:57.960 --> 06:58.840
Thank you.

110
06:59.120 --> 07:01.560
Charge it to the room account.

111
07:02.720 --> 07:03.360
Thank you.

112
07:05.000 --> 07:06.000
Think you're so loaded, huh?

113
07:07.600 --> 07:09.640
I'll help you blow through that money, you jerk.

114
07:20.880 --> 07:22.040
Oh, you're home?

115
07:24.480 --> 07:25.720
You're not in bed yet, Mom?

116
07:25.800 --> 07:26.360
Not yet.

117
07:27.360 --> 07:29.000
You've only been away for a few days,

118
07:29.520 --> 07:31.000
but you've got a bit of a tan.

119
07:31.880 --> 07:33.600
What's that mark on your neck?

120
07:34.040 --> 07:35.200
Just a little accident.

121
07:35.480 --> 07:37.640
That face of yours doesn't just belong to you.

122
07:39.880 --> 07:41.800
It carries the name of the Sukonsiri family.

123
07:46.560 --> 07:48.080
It's just a small scratch.

124
07:48.120 --> 07:49.640
Put some ointment on it, and it'll heal in no time.

125
07:49.640 --> 07:52.120
You'll be fine for Mr. Jomphol's party tomorrow.

126
07:52.120 --> 07:53.520
No one will even notice it.

127
07:54.159 --> 07:55.840
A party tomorrow?

128
07:57.440 --> 07:58.880
It's a welcome party, son.

129
07:59.080 --> 08:02.120
Mr. Jomphol is your dad's business partner from the U.S.

130
08:02.440 --> 08:04.040
He's moving back to Thailand for good.

131
08:04.040 --> 08:05.720
He has a very talented daughter.

132
08:05.760 --> 08:07.000
She's pretty, too.

133
08:07.200 --> 08:08.280
Why don't you pick her up tomorrow?

134
08:08.280 --> 08:10.280
I've already prepared a bouquet for you.

135
08:13.000 --> 08:14.040
I'm sorry.

136
08:14.280 --> 08:15.560
I'm busy tomorrow.

137
08:16.000 --> 08:17.360
I have to study for exams.

138
08:17.600 --> 08:18.680
I can't make it.

139
08:21.000 --> 08:22.440
You knew you had exams coming up.

140
08:22.480 --> 08:24.160
Why didn't you study ahead of time?

141
08:24.360 --> 08:25.800
Your internship

142
08:25.840 --> 08:27.360
is affecting your studies, isn't it?

143
08:28.440 --> 08:31.480
Your brother is spoiling you too much.

144
08:35.520 --> 08:36.320
It's okay, son.

145
08:36.360 --> 08:38.640
Put some ointment on it, and it'll heal soon.

146
08:38.679 --> 08:39.400
Okay.

147
08:39.880 --> 08:41.400
-If you'll excuse me... -Go on.

148
09:11.440 --> 09:13.800
[Ing: www.xxx.com. Study hard, okay?]

149
09:37.480 --> 09:38.240
Come in.

150
09:49.120 --> 09:50.400
You again, Secretary Piang?

151
09:52.120 --> 09:54.320
Unfortunately, it's me again.

152
09:55.240 --> 09:56.520
Were you expecting someone else?

153
09:57.960 --> 09:59.600
These are the important documents

154
09:59.600 --> 10:01.120
Mr. Yok sent over.

155
10:03.160 --> 10:05.080
Isn't he supposed to be handling this project?

156
10:06.000 --> 10:08.560
Yes, but he's currently on leave.

157
10:09.200 --> 10:10.960
The reason being...

158
10:11.560 --> 10:13.800
severe UV sensitivity.

159
10:16.000 --> 10:17.200
That's a pathetic excuse.

160
10:17.360 --> 10:18.560
A whole month off? #VO

161
10:18.640 --> 10:20.120
What's he even thinking? #VO

162
10:20.120 --> 10:21.560
He literally asked to intern here.

163
10:21.560 --> 10:22.960
Why is he taking so much time off?

164
10:23.640 --> 10:25.360
Should I call him

165
10:25.360 --> 10:27.440
and tell him to work night shifts instead?

166
10:27.920 --> 10:30.160
That way, he avoid the UV rays.

167
10:30.880 --> 10:32.400
Or should we move his desk

168
10:32.400 --> 10:35.160
to a dark corner somewhere?

169
10:35.200 --> 10:35.760
So there won't be...

170
10:35.760 --> 10:37.000
Enough, stop talking.

171
10:37.640 --> 10:38.040
Go.

172
10:38.640 --> 10:39.520
Get back to work.

173
10:40.160 --> 10:40.840
Yes, sir.

174
10:48.760 --> 10:50.960
[Ing: Are you coming to the office tomorrow?]

175
10:50.960 --> 10:53.120
[Ing: Hello?]

176
10:56.880 --> 10:57.960
Jeez, my shirt.

177
11:04.720 --> 11:05.680
Dammit.

178
11:09.760 --> 11:10.800
There's coffee all over it.

179
11:16.520 --> 11:18.000
Everything is such a mess.

180
11:20.000 --> 11:21.440
If I want someone...

181
11:23.320 --> 11:24.440
I don't need to beg you.

182
11:24.480 --> 11:25.640
You think you're all that?

183
11:26.560 --> 11:27.840
I can find someone anytime.

184
11:27.880 --> 11:29.680
[Ing: Typing...]

185
11:29.680 --> 11:31.680
[Ing: I'm coming to see you at the shop.]

186
11:34.320 --> 11:35.040
Vince.

187
11:36.360 --> 11:37.200
Vince.

188
11:40.120 --> 11:40.960
Vince...

189
11:43.800 --> 11:45.200
Mr. Vince isn't back yet, sir.

190
11:56.680 --> 11:58.320
Then you cut my hair for me.

191
12:17.280 --> 12:18.080
What's your name?

192
12:20.120 --> 12:21.400
My name is Junior.

193
12:21.440 --> 12:24.160
I've only been here for a month.

194
12:24.400 --> 12:26.560
If I don't do a very good job,

195
12:27.040 --> 12:28.520
I'd like to apologize in advance, Mr. Ing.

196
12:28.880 --> 12:30.080
It's fine. Just get on with it.

197
12:32.920 --> 12:33.880
How old are you?

198
12:35.200 --> 12:36.080
I'm 21.

199
12:48.680 --> 12:50.840
How long have you been working for Vince?

200
12:51.320 --> 12:51.880
Well...

201
12:52.960 --> 12:54.160
I've only been here for a month.

202
13:13.520 --> 13:14.080
Hey.

203
13:15.480 --> 13:18.520
Is this really how a CEO's hair should look?

204
13:19.000 --> 13:21.520
I'm not some rookie in a boy group, you know.

205
13:21.720 --> 13:23.960
Whoa, Ing. Calm down, man.

206
13:25.120 --> 13:26.760
Hey, what are you standing there for?

207
13:26.800 --> 13:27.680
Beat it.

208
13:29.280 --> 13:29.720
Yes, sir.

209
13:30.560 --> 13:31.120
Come on.

210
13:31.400 --> 13:32.240
Here, just sit down.

211
13:32.280 --> 13:33.440
Stop talking too much.

212
13:33.440 --> 13:34.640
Look at what happened to my hair.

213
13:34.800 --> 13:36.120
-Sit down first. -Fix my hair already.

214
13:36.120 --> 13:37.000
What hairstyle do you want?

215
13:37.040 --> 13:38.040
I'll sort you out myself.

216
13:38.480 --> 13:40.080
Just the usual. Nothing fancy.

217
13:40.920 --> 13:42.120
Don't be so hard on the kid.

218
13:42.120 --> 13:43.120
He's still new.

219
13:43.280 --> 13:45.120
You really know how to spot a good one.

220
13:46.720 --> 13:48.960
Junior is a naive one.

221
13:51.400 --> 13:52.560
Want me to set you up with him?

222
13:52.760 --> 13:53.440
No.

223
13:55.560 --> 13:56.320
I'm off.

224
13:58.760 --> 13:59.640
No need to see me out.

225
14:01.160 --> 14:01.920
Mr. Ing...

226
14:04.280 --> 14:05.760
I'm really sorry about earlier.

227
14:15.080 --> 14:16.120
Go get yourself a treat.

228
14:46.920 --> 14:47.600
Hello?

229
14:48.960 --> 14:50.520
I'm lost here at your college.

230
14:50.560 --> 14:51.280
Come pick me up.

231
14:51.320 --> 14:52.440
What are you doing here?

232
14:52.440 --> 14:53.160
I'm busy.

233
14:53.200 --> 14:54.480
Can't I just come for no reason?

234
14:54.520 --> 14:55.960
It's not like they charge an entrance fee.

235
14:56.000 --> 14:56.800
Bye.

236
14:56.840 --> 14:59.640
Hold on. I'm actually lost,

237
14:59.640 --> 15:00.840
and the mosquitoes here...

238
15:00.840 --> 15:02.480
are bigger than helicopters.

239
15:02.800 --> 15:04.200
Your phone has data.

240
15:04.520 --> 15:05.840
Just use a map to find your way out.

241
15:06.120 --> 15:07.480
But the signal is glitching.

242
15:07.760 --> 15:09.480
Why do you think I'm calling you, then?

243
15:09.520 --> 15:11.360
You don't even know where you are.

244
15:11.440 --> 15:12.800
How am I supposed to know?

245
15:12.880 --> 15:14.640
I'm right next to a big tree.

246
15:15.880 --> 15:17.440
There are hundreds of trees here.

247
15:17.560 --> 15:18.560
Which one are you at?

248
15:18.920 --> 15:20.920
If you're not here to pick me up in ten minutes,

249
15:20.960 --> 15:21.880
I'll call Mr. Phet

250
15:21.880 --> 15:23.320
and tell him you dumped me after sleeping with me.

251
15:23.480 --> 15:24.160
What?

252
15:24.440 --> 15:25.720
The clock is ticking.

253
15:25.720 --> 15:26.760
Better hurry up.

254
15:58.720 --> 16:00.000
What exactly are you doing here?

255
16:02.720 --> 16:03.640
I'm here to see you

256
16:05.680 --> 16:07.000
and to see that...

257
16:09.200 --> 16:10.640
you're still hooked on me.

258
16:13.680 --> 16:15.280
I'll ride ahead and guide you to the exit.

259
16:22.320 --> 16:24.200
What happened isn't going to end that easily.

260
16:32.160 --> 16:33.760
I'm sorry for what I did.

261
16:34.520 --> 16:35.960
I don't lean that way.

262
16:36.320 --> 16:37.320
I'm begging you.

263
16:37.560 --> 16:38.840
Please don't bring this up again.

264
16:38.960 --> 16:40.680
Oh, you're sorry?

265
16:40.960 --> 16:41.880
You don't lean that way?

266
16:43.040 --> 16:44.280
Well, but you already did it.

267
16:46.120 --> 16:47.640
You still owe me.

268
16:49.560 --> 16:50.720
Are you out of your mind?

269
16:50.760 --> 16:52.760
Yeah, I am.

270
16:58.760 --> 16:59.440
Let go of me.

271
17:03.520 --> 17:04.280
Why?

272
17:04.800 --> 17:05.319
What?

273
17:17.599 --> 17:21.040
Why does your body seem more honest than you are?

274
17:26.480 --> 17:27.400
Follow me.

275
17:29.520 --> 17:30.200
P'Ing...

276
17:40.880 --> 17:42.080
Why are you trying to run away?

277
18:09.760 --> 18:11.520
You didn't mean what you said, did you?

278
18:50.440 --> 18:51.920
I'll be gentle this time. #VO

279
18:52.160 --> 18:52.880
Wait.

280
19:01.000 --> 19:01.880
Why?

281
19:02.560 --> 19:04.080
You came all this way...

282
19:06.400 --> 19:07.760
Wasn't it for this?

283
19:10.080 --> 19:11.440
You still owe me.

284
19:12.120 --> 19:14.400
This time, I'm getting inside you.

285
19:40.800 --> 19:41.600
Wait.

286
19:42.240 --> 19:43.640
If you're not okay with this,

287
19:43.920 --> 19:45.280
we don't have to do it.

288
19:45.280 --> 19:45.800
I...

289
19:49.320 --> 19:50.280
Don't you think this is too much?

290
19:51.280 --> 19:52.920
You're going to tease me and just run away?

291
19:53.720 --> 19:55.400
If you didn't want this, why did you come here?

292
19:55.440 --> 19:57.240
Oh, if that's how it is,

293
19:57.800 --> 19:59.120
then let me have you.

294
19:59.720 --> 20:00.600
You'll see

295
20:00.640 --> 20:02.600
just how much better it feels.

296
20:05.520 --> 20:06.920
What's the big deal?

297
20:06.960 --> 20:08.160
It's just about who's on top or bottom.

298
20:08.160 --> 20:08.960
Forget it.

299
20:09.680 --> 20:10.120
I'm leaving.

300
20:11.320 --> 20:12.560
I'm not letting you go anywhere.

301
20:15.960 --> 20:16.560
Yok...

302
20:24.440 --> 20:24.960
Yok...

303
20:32.520 --> 20:33.400
P'Ing,

304
20:34.600 --> 20:35.960
please let me do it.

305
20:40.920 --> 20:42.000
Wait a second,

306
20:42.000 --> 20:43.920
I have a condom in my bag.

307
20:47.880 --> 20:48.440
P'Ing,

308
20:49.440 --> 20:50.880
I'm going in now.

309
20:51.200 --> 20:52.320
You talk too much.

310
21:46.160 --> 21:47.200
Let me tie it for you.

311
21:49.960 --> 21:51.800
Why bother? It's late already.

312
21:52.560 --> 21:53.520
No one's going to see.

313
21:53.520 --> 21:54.240
P'Ing,

314
21:54.280 --> 21:55.120
just let me tie it,

315
21:55.680 --> 21:56.520
or it'll be too revealing.

316
21:57.200 --> 21:58.040
Why?

317
21:58.720 --> 21:59.960
-Well... -I want to show some skin.

318
22:00.000 --> 22:01.040
I want to show off.

319
22:02.760 --> 22:04.040
Why are you in such a bad mood?

320
22:04.680 --> 22:05.960
There's no reason for it.

321
22:09.160 --> 22:10.240
I can't hold back anymore.

322
22:16.760 --> 22:17.680
Are you hungry?

323
22:19.000 --> 22:20.480
Wanna grab a bite together?

324
22:27.160 --> 22:27.920
Yeah.

325
22:28.400 --> 22:29.640
Now that sounds more interesting.

326
22:33.160 --> 22:34.040
What are you smiling at?

327
22:58.680 --> 23:00.400
People will think

328
23:00.440 --> 23:02.000
I tricked you into coming with me.

329
23:03.840 --> 23:05.480
It's not like you haven't fooled me about other things.

330
23:36.360 --> 23:38.400
I don't usually peel my own prawns.

331
23:57.960 --> 23:59.160
Happy now?

332
24:02.400 --> 24:05.080
Well, it'll do.

333
24:05.760 --> 24:07.160
You're quite a pro at peeling prawns.

334
24:22.240 --> 24:23.320
This mookrata place

335
24:23.360 --> 24:24.800
is Itt's favorite.

336
24:24.960 --> 24:27.120
Every time he comes to see me, we always end up here.

337
24:29.280 --> 24:30.880
Can we not talk about anyone else?

338
24:42.840 --> 24:43.800
Let's go.

339
24:47.800 --> 24:49.080
No one has treated me

340
24:49.080 --> 24:50.160
to a meal this cheap before.

341
24:51.920 --> 24:52.640
Why is that?

342
24:52.680 --> 24:53.680
Why is that?

343
24:54.160 --> 24:55.920
Am I only worth this much?

344
24:56.640 --> 24:57.840
Keep it down, P'Ing.

345
24:57.880 --> 24:59.120
Keep what down?

346
25:01.520 --> 25:03.000
Why? Was the food not edible?

347
25:03.640 --> 25:04.840
You enjoyed it, didn't you?

348
25:04.920 --> 25:05.920
Well, I did.

349
25:06.480 --> 25:08.080
So what does the price have to do with it?

350
25:12.080 --> 25:13.280
I'm going to buy this place.

351
25:15.200 --> 25:16.600
-P'Ing. -Why?

352
25:16.880 --> 25:18.160
-Keep it down. -I'm going to buy this whole place.

353
25:18.200 --> 25:19.000
What's wrong?

354
25:20.280 --> 25:22.280
Just tell me how much it is, and I'll buy it.

355
25:24.720 --> 25:25.800
[Im-Jung Mookrata Buffet]

356
25:25.800 --> 25:26.920
[188 baht per person, drinks included]

357
25:37.160 --> 25:39.680
#CG

358
25:43.440 --> 25:44.160
[Ing: What are you doing?]

359
25:46.160 --> 25:47.000
[Yok: Typing...]

360
25:47.000 --> 25:47.600
[Yok: Studying.]

361
25:47.640 --> 25:49.120
[Yok: Studying.]

362
25:52.360 --> 25:53.280
[Ing: Typing...]

363
25:53.320 --> 25:54.960
[Ing: I'll send you some study guides.]

364
26:02.240 --> 26:07.040
[Yok: Can you be serious for once?]

365
26:07.080 --> 26:09.280
[Ing: When you were taking off my pants,]

366
26:09.320 --> 26:10.600
[you didn't seem all that serious.]

367
26:12.920 --> 26:18.040
#CG

368
26:46.240 --> 26:47.080
Come in.

369
26:58.840 --> 26:59.640
What is it?

370
27:01.640 --> 27:02.680
P'Ing, lately...

371
27:02.680 --> 27:04.280
What did I tell you about where we are?

372
27:07.560 --> 27:09.400
Oh, right.

373
27:11.240 --> 27:11.960
Mr. Ing,

374
27:12.000 --> 27:13.760
these are the documents from the Department of Lands

375
27:13.840 --> 27:15.160
you asked for last time.

376
27:15.800 --> 27:17.600
For the parts that couldn't be photocopied,

377
27:17.840 --> 27:19.560
I've transcribed them by hand for you.

378
27:20.160 --> 27:21.000
Okay.

379
27:23.040 --> 27:24.040
Good. Put them over there.

380
27:24.080 --> 27:25.040
I'll take a look later.

381
27:29.560 --> 27:30.440
What is it?

382
27:32.200 --> 27:34.320
The mark on your neck...

383
27:38.960 --> 27:40.160
Let me help you with that.

384
27:48.400 --> 27:49.280
Mr. Ing,

385
27:49.800 --> 27:50.880
lately,

386
27:51.480 --> 27:53.040
you haven't been coming home much.

387
27:55.680 --> 27:57.240
Dad asked me to tell you

388
27:57.640 --> 28:00.120
to come home and eat with us when you get the chance.

389
28:01.280 --> 28:02.080
Alright.

390
28:02.520 --> 28:04.000
I'll head over if I have the time.

391
28:04.440 --> 28:05.280
Understood.

392
28:05.560 --> 28:06.760
And...

393
28:07.480 --> 28:09.720
thank you for buying that car for me, Mr. Ing.

394
28:10.920 --> 28:12.160
Just get back to work.

395
28:13.600 --> 28:14.400
Yes, sir.

396
28:14.720 --> 28:15.920
I'll be off, then.

397
28:22.080 --> 28:22.920
Wait.

398
28:25.200 --> 28:25.960
Yes?

399
28:28.880 --> 28:30.400
Do you see Yok often?

400
28:31.560 --> 28:33.920
Oh, just once in a while.

401
28:38.720 --> 28:39.440
Well,

402
28:40.160 --> 28:41.240
it's nothing.

403
28:43.560 --> 28:44.320
By the way,

404
28:44.880 --> 28:46.520
now that you have the time and money,

405
28:46.520 --> 28:47.960
why don't you try dating someone?

406
28:49.520 --> 28:50.720
What do you mean by that?

407
28:51.520 --> 28:52.520
I mean, I want you

408
28:52.600 --> 28:54.200
to stop being single.

409
28:54.400 --> 28:55.240
You have time and money.

410
28:55.240 --> 28:56.600
Just date someone.

411
28:58.400 --> 28:59.480
Well...

412
28:59.840 --> 29:02.640
I haven't met the right woman yet.

413
29:02.680 --> 29:04.400
Then go meet people.

414
29:04.880 --> 29:07.040
Go on plenty of dates, and you'll find someone.

415
29:07.080 --> 29:09.520
You can't wait for fate to do all the work.

416
29:13.880 --> 29:14.800
Well...

417
29:16.680 --> 29:17.760
These days,

418
29:18.400 --> 29:20.160
do teens like eating at the market?

419
29:21.400 --> 29:22.040
Yeah.

420
29:22.520 --> 29:23.800
The food's cheap and delicious.

421
29:24.120 --> 29:25.160
Why do you ask?

422
29:25.200 --> 29:26.200
Is it...

423
29:27.760 --> 29:29.000
because someone took you there?

424
29:30.560 --> 29:32.000
You're just talking nonsense.

425
29:32.760 --> 29:34.680
Tell Dad I'll be coming over for a meal this Friday.

426
29:35.280 --> 29:36.120
Alright.

427
29:37.920 --> 29:39.120
I'm heading out, then.

428
30:01.240 --> 30:02.160
Hello, Itt.

429
30:03.080 --> 30:03.960
What are you up to?

430
30:04.400 --> 30:05.560
I'm mopping the boxing gym.

431
30:05.600 --> 30:06.680
It's my turn today.

432
30:07.280 --> 30:08.120
What's up?

433
30:09.560 --> 30:12.000
Hey, have you seen P'Ing lately?

434
30:14.480 --> 30:16.760
I saw him once at the office the other day.

435
30:19.000 --> 30:19.960
Why do you ask?

436
30:20.360 --> 30:21.320
It's nothing.

437
30:21.840 --> 30:23.520
My brother seems really busy lately.

438
30:23.640 --> 30:24.960
He rarely picks up his phone.

439
30:35.200 --> 30:36.160
Itt,

440
30:36.520 --> 30:38.520
between me and P'Ing...

441
30:39.080 --> 30:40.440
There's nothing going on, right?

442
30:44.080 --> 30:45.200
P'Ing already told me.

443
30:45.240 --> 30:46.440
Don't overthink it.

444
30:47.040 --> 30:48.240
I was just asking.

445
30:54.040 --> 30:55.040
Talk to you later.

446
31:10.080 --> 31:12.560
[Yok: Typing...]

447
31:12.600 --> 31:14.400
[Yok: I've been training really hard lately.]

448
31:14.440 --> 31:16.040
[Let's not meet up just yet.]

449
31:16.040 --> 31:20.000
[Ing: Does it mean you were going to come see me?]

450
31:33.520 --> 31:35.000
So you called me here...

451
31:35.040 --> 31:36.480
just for something like this?

452
31:37.520 --> 31:38.760
Why don't you tell me how long

453
31:38.800 --> 31:40.440
that woman's been whispering in your ear?

454
31:43.040 --> 31:44.520
How can you say such a thing?

455
31:44.880 --> 31:46.200
Itt is your brother.

456
31:46.200 --> 31:47.040
And since when

457
31:47.080 --> 31:48.400
have I not been good to him?

458
31:48.440 --> 31:50.440
He's just a college student right now.

459
31:50.480 --> 31:52.000
What does he even need shares for?

460
31:52.840 --> 31:54.360
What's wrong with transferring some shares

461
31:54.400 --> 31:56.040
to your brother?

462
31:58.280 --> 32:00.520
Do you think that woman cares about you?

463
32:00.520 --> 32:02.680
The reason she's begging for shares for her son

464
32:02.680 --> 32:04.440
is that you've got one foot in the grave.

465
32:04.440 --> 32:05.240
Ing, you...

466
32:07.680 --> 32:08.920
Fine, whatever.

467
32:09.160 --> 32:10.720
If you're so unhappy about it,

468
32:11.040 --> 32:12.720
I'll just transfer my own shares to him.

469
32:14.880 --> 32:16.640
You can do whatever you want, Dad,

470
32:17.880 --> 32:19.440
but let me warn you about one thing.

471
32:20.520 --> 32:22.920
Half of the shares I gave you belong to my mom.

472
32:24.040 --> 32:26.440
You have no right to touch her shares.

473
32:35.800 --> 32:37.960
I think we should go eat here.

474
32:38.000 --> 32:39.240
Let's go to the beach.

475
32:41.120 --> 32:43.400
They say the seafood there is amazing.

476
32:43.400 --> 32:45.560
-Really? I'm craving shrimp. -Yeah.

477
32:46.080 --> 32:47.360
Let's go have some crab.

478
32:47.400 --> 32:48.080
Let's go to...

479
32:52.120 --> 32:54.400
Who put this worthless junk in my house?

480
32:57.600 --> 32:59.320
It was you, wasn't it, Arisara?

481
33:01.920 --> 33:03.640
Just because you live in this house

482
33:03.640 --> 33:05.520
doesn't mean you own the place.

483
33:06.800 --> 33:08.680
One person with no taste in this house is plenty.

484
33:09.560 --> 33:11.520
No need to add something this tacky.

485
33:50.040 --> 33:51.000
Hello?

486
33:52.080 --> 33:53.080
What are you doing?

487
33:54.000 --> 33:54.960
I'm watching a movie.

488
33:55.160 --> 33:56.040
Are you on a date?

489
33:56.720 --> 33:57.760
I'm watching it on my laptop.

490
33:58.600 --> 34:00.200
Oh...

491
34:02.920 --> 34:04.520
Is it that site I sent you?

492
34:04.800 --> 34:06.880
Can't you say anything decent for once?

493
34:09.760 --> 34:10.719
By the way,

494
34:10.719 --> 34:12.880
Mr. Ravit from the Damnoen Saduak hotel project

495
34:12.920 --> 34:14.679
has submitted the proposal for approval.

496
34:14.800 --> 34:16.440
They had a few comments.

497
34:16.480 --> 34:18.239
I'll email them to you tomorrow.

498
34:18.639 --> 34:19.840
I'm sorry.

499
34:21.120 --> 34:22.760
It's just that...

500
34:23.120 --> 34:24.600
I can't receive emails right now.

501
34:24.960 --> 34:26.600
Just bring it over yourself tomorrow.

502
34:27.199 --> 34:28.800
Since when did you stop accepting emails?

503
34:30.480 --> 34:31.480
Just now.

504
34:55.760 --> 34:57.600
How many times have I told you

505
34:58.760 --> 34:59.560
not to wear this kind of outfit

506
34:59.600 --> 35:00.760
when you come here?

507
35:02.640 --> 35:03.520
I already told you

508
35:03.560 --> 35:05.000
I have practice right after this.

509
35:05.160 --> 35:06.400
I don't have time to change.

510
35:06.840 --> 35:07.880
Here are the documents.

511
35:35.720 --> 35:36.640
Hey.

512
35:39.320 --> 35:40.680
This time,

513
35:41.720 --> 35:43.480
I didn't force you to do that.

514
35:47.000 --> 35:48.640
You called me all this way...

515
35:49.000 --> 35:50.680
just for this, didn't you?

516
35:55.440 --> 35:57.320
Since you're giving in to me this easily,

517
35:59.280 --> 36:00.240
just let me have you for once,

518
36:00.280 --> 36:02.360
and I'll never snap at you again.

519
36:07.640 --> 36:11.920
Why won't you just give up on this already?

520
36:14.560 --> 36:16.600
In my dictionary,

521
36:18.560 --> 36:20.080
there's no such word as...

522
36:24.640 --> 36:25.560
giving up.

523
36:30.520 --> 36:31.440
Who is it?

524
36:31.520 --> 36:33.520
Mr. Ing, Mr. Pite is here.

525
36:36.040 --> 36:37.240
P'Ing...

526
36:43.480 --> 36:44.520
You again...

527
36:45.240 --> 36:46.640
Every time you show up, it's nothing but trouble.

528
36:49.240 --> 36:50.400
What do you want?

529
36:58.680 --> 36:59.680
Yok, you can leave.

530
37:00.960 --> 37:01.560
Okay.

531
37:10.000 --> 37:10.920
Look at your face.

532
37:11.680 --> 37:13.080
Was it your debt collectors or something?

533
37:13.480 --> 37:14.680
P'Ing...

534
37:15.560 --> 37:17.240
So I got roughed up.

535
37:17.280 --> 37:19.520
I've warned you so many times, but you never listened.

536
37:19.800 --> 37:20.760
Even your dad won't help you.

537
37:20.800 --> 37:22.240
What makes you think I will?

538
37:23.080 --> 37:24.680
I'm begging you.

539
37:24.720 --> 37:26.040
I promise I'll never do it again.

540
37:26.720 --> 37:28.680
P'Ing, please ask my dad

541
37:28.680 --> 37:30.240
to clear my debt.

542
37:30.560 --> 37:32.040
Or...

543
37:32.400 --> 37:34.280
could you lend me some money?

544
37:34.480 --> 37:35.200
Please.

545
37:35.640 --> 37:37.960
Please, I'm really begging you.

546
37:39.040 --> 37:40.880
Please, P'Ing.

547
37:40.920 --> 37:41.880
I won't do it again.

548
37:41.880 --> 37:43.120
This is the last time.

549
37:43.160 --> 37:44.280
How many times have you said that?

550
37:44.320 --> 37:45.720
Probably a hundred.

551
37:45.800 --> 37:47.400
I'd be an idiot to believe you.

552
37:47.640 --> 37:49.320
Do you see this mark on my lip?

553
37:49.560 --> 37:51.120
He pointed a gun at me, man.

554
37:51.120 --> 37:51.960
He's going to kill me

555
37:52.000 --> 37:53.400
if I don't pay him back.

556
37:53.400 --> 37:54.320
I'm begging you.

557
37:54.320 --> 37:55.160
This is really the last time.

558
37:55.200 --> 37:56.360
I've learned my lesson.

559
37:56.400 --> 37:57.600
Alright, fine.

560
37:57.920 --> 37:58.640
You little jerk.

561
37:58.880 --> 38:00.440
I'll talk to your dad.

562
38:00.960 --> 38:02.080
If it weren't for your mom,

563
38:02.120 --> 38:03.280
you'd be dead meat by now.

564
38:03.280 --> 38:04.160
You'll talk to my dad?

565
38:04.520 --> 38:05.640
Do you really think

566
38:05.680 --> 38:07.040
he'll just hand over 15 million?

567
38:07.080 --> 38:08.400
I said I'll talk to him for you.

568
38:08.400 --> 38:09.800
Are you not listening?

569
38:10.400 --> 38:11.640
Now get out.

570
38:12.400 --> 38:13.240
No...

571
38:13.280 --> 38:15.200
Are you leaving or not?

572
38:17.880 --> 38:19.440
Fine, I'm leaving.

573
38:25.400 --> 38:27.720
That jerk is nothing but trouble.

574
38:33.960 --> 38:34.760
P'Pite,

575
38:34.760 --> 38:36.520
are you alright?

576
38:38.640 --> 38:40.560
Oh, it's nothing.

577
38:41.240 --> 38:42.920
I bet you're hungry.

578
38:42.960 --> 38:44.320
Let me treat you to a meal.

579
38:44.720 --> 38:45.560
What?

580
38:46.320 --> 38:47.080
Let's go.

581
39:01.640 --> 39:03.360
Okay, I'm heading out.

582
39:04.120 --> 39:05.040
Thank you, P'Khun.

583
39:21.040 --> 39:21.920
Who was that?

584
39:28.000 --> 39:29.200
He's my coach.

585
39:29.240 --> 39:29.800
[Khongsittha Muay Thai]

586
39:38.600 --> 39:39.480
Your coach?

587
39:41.920 --> 39:43.040
He looks the part,

588
39:43.040 --> 39:45.240
but he seems a bit old with all that gray hair.

589
39:46.440 --> 39:47.640
Does he train you?

590
39:48.880 --> 39:49.600
Yes.

591
39:49.760 --> 39:51.280
He was training me while I was waiting for you.

592
39:56.080 --> 39:57.360
Talking like that...

593
39:57.840 --> 39:59.160
Now that's more like it.

594
40:02.840 --> 40:03.440
Look at you.

595
40:03.800 --> 40:06.320
You're all sweaty. Go take a shower.

596
40:16.880 --> 40:18.080
Let's go shower together.

597
40:18.920 --> 40:20.200
Don't drop the soap...

598
40:40.720 --> 40:41.480
Hey, Yok.

599
40:41.560 --> 40:42.200
Look.

600
40:44.120 --> 40:45.120
You want to do it here?

601
40:46.280 --> 40:47.240
Can't I?

602
40:48.120 --> 40:48.880
You can.

603
40:49.720 --> 40:51.400
Just make it quick, then.

604
41:04.160 --> 41:05.160
Someone's coming.

605
41:12.440 --> 41:14.160
Now we can go all out.

606
41:14.360 --> 41:15.880
All out, huh?

607
41:28.880 --> 41:29.960
Tomorrow's a day off.

608
41:29.960 --> 41:31.560
You have to keep me company.

609
41:31.560 --> 41:32.720
Hello, Mom.

610
41:32.720 --> 41:34.520
I have something to take care of at the college.

611
41:34.520 --> 41:36.680
I won't be able to come home for a few days.

612
41:36.680 --> 41:38.640
Usually, Ing doesn't take anyone under his wing.

613
41:38.640 --> 41:40.120
That means you must be pretty special.

614
41:41.040 --> 41:42.000
Don't tell your friends about us again.

615
41:42.720 --> 41:43.760
You're acting all disgusted.

616
41:44.000 --> 41:45.240
Do I look that disgusting?

617
41:45.920 --> 41:46.440
P'Ing,

618
41:48.040 --> 41:48.960
do we have to talk about it now?

619
41:49.280 --> 41:50.240
Someone might see us.

620
41:50.480 --> 41:51.920
I'm a straightforward guy.

621
41:52.240 --> 41:52.880
And let me tell you this,

622
41:53.080 --> 41:54.920
it won't be long before I make you
